
MASTER ENGINEERING PROMPT — REBUILD EDRAW AS A GENERAL ENGINEERING GRAPHICS QUESTION INTERPRETATION AND SOLVING SYSTEM

1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior software architect, OCR engineer, engineering graphics domain expert, computational geometry engineer, mathematics specialist, and full-stack developer.

Your task is to inspect, debug, refactor, and complete my existing EDraw application.

EDraw is an AI-powered Engineering Graphics learning and problem-solving application. It must accept engineering drawing questions in image or text form, understand the question regardless of how it is worded, convert it into structured JSON, identify mathematical constraints, solve the problem, generate appropriate JavaScript output, and present a correct, explainable solution.

This is an implementation task, not a request for a design proposal.

Inspect the actual codebase, implement the changes, integrate them into the existing application, and verify the result.

